Hunting Lab desktop plugin (hermes-hunt-bots)

plugin.js is generated by framework/hunt_lab/desktop_src/build_console.py from
the authored sources in framework/hunt_lab/desktop_src/ and the pinned noVNC
1.6.0 source recorded in console-provenance.json. Do not edit it by hand.

